<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Lxc on 瘦了就帅了</title><link>https://blog.cuile.com/tags/lxc/</link><description>Recent content in Lxc on 瘦了就帅了</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 16:52:53 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.cuile.com/tags/lxc/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>配置 CentOS 7 的 CT 容器</title><link>https://blog.cuile.com/post/proxmox/setup_ct_centos-7/</link><pubDate>Wed, 31 Jan 2024 21:37:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.cuile.com/post/proxmox/setup_ct_centos-7/</guid><description>&lt;p>Proxmox VE 官方提供的 Centos 7 模板是有问题的无法正常使用，现在给出解决方案。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="安装">安装&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>安装完成后，容器可以启动，但无法关闭、网络无法使用、控制台无法使用，这些都是我们要解决的问题。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="解决方法">解决方法&lt;/h2>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>ssh登录进入PVE主机&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 查看 CT 容器列表&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ pct list
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 进入 CT 容器&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ pct enter &amp;lt;VMID&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ol start="2">
&lt;li>打开网络&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 启动网络，从DHCP拿IP地址&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ ifup eth0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ol start="3">
&lt;li>更新 yum 库&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ curl -o /etc/yum.repos.d/jsynacek-systemd-backports-for-centos-7-epel-7.repo https://copr.fedorainfracloud.org/coprs/jsynacek/systemd-backports-for-centos-7/repo/epel-7/jsynacek-systemd-backports-for-centos-7-epel-7.repo
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ yum update
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 安装 sshd&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ yum install -y openssh-server
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ systemctl start sshd.service
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ systemctl &lt;span class="nb">enable&lt;/span> sshd.service
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ol start="4">
&lt;li>退出 CT 容器&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ &lt;span class="nb">exit&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ pct stop &amp;lt;VMID&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ol start="5">
&lt;li>重新启动 CT 容器，一切正常&amp;mdash;&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://forum.proxmox.com/threads/pve-7-wont-start-centos-7-container.97834/#post-425419">[SOLVED] - PVE 7 won&amp;rsquo;t start CentOS 7 container | Proxmox Support Forum&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>ProxmoxVE 命令</title><link>https://blog.cuile.com/post/proxmox/cli/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Dec 2022 16:51:54 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.cuile.com/post/proxmox/cli/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://pve.proxmox.com/pve-docs/index.html">遇事不决，多读文档！&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="qemukvm虚拟机">QEMU/KVM虚拟机&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 增加硬盘空间&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 建议从模板创建虚拟机后，再增加虚拟机硬盘的空间，这样可以保持模板的大小&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">qm disk resize &amp;lt;VM_ID&amp;gt; scsi0 +30G
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 关闭&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">qm stop &amp;lt;vmid&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 如果关闭失败&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">qm list
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 找到 vm 对应的 pid&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">kill&lt;/span> &amp;lt;pid&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 删除&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">qm destroy &amp;lt;vmid&amp;gt; --destroy-unreferenced-disks &lt;span class="m">1&lt;/span> --purge &lt;span class="m">1&lt;/span> --skiplock &lt;span class="m">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 强制删除&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">rm -f /etc/pve/nodes/*/*/&amp;lt;vm_id&amp;gt;.conf
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;a href="https://blog.pulipuli.info/2014/08/proxmox-ve-fix-proxmox-ve-destroy.html#postcataproxmox-ve-fix-proxmox-ve-destroy.html0_anchor2">修復Proxmox VE：無法刪除虛擬機器&lt;/a>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2 id="lxc容器">LXC容器&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 扩大硬盘&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 将容器的 rootfs 增加到绝对大小&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pct resize &amp;lt;lxc_id&amp;gt; rootfs &amp;lt;size&amp;gt;G
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 将容器的 rootfs 增加相对大小&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pct resize &amp;lt;lxc_id&amp;gt; rootfs +&amp;lt;size&amp;gt;G
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 缩小硬盘&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 备份lxc&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vzdump &amp;lt;lxc_id&amp;gt; --mode stop --compress zstd --storage &amp;lt;storage_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 删除lxc&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pct shutdown &amp;lt;lxc_id&amp;gt; 
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pct destroy &amp;lt;lxc_id&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 恢复到指定大小，size默认单位是G&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pct restore &amp;lt;lxc_id&amp;gt; /var/lib/vz/dump/&amp;lt;backup_name&amp;gt; --rootfs &amp;lt;storage_name&amp;gt;:&amp;lt;size&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 关闭&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pct list
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pct stop &amp;lt;vmid&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;hr>
&lt;h2 id="存储">存储&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 查看存储空间使用情况&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pvesm status
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 查看存储内的文件&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pvesm list &amp;lt;storage_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 查看存储配置&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">cat /etc/pve/storage.cfg
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 给local存储添加存储类型&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pvesm &lt;span class="nb">set&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">local&lt;/span> --content snippets,rootdir,import,images,backup,vztmpl,iso
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 注意！！！片段文件只能放在 /var/lib/vz/snippets/ 目录下，不支持子目录&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 将local-lvm(LVM-Thin)合并到local&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 移动虚拟机硬盘到local&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">qm disk move &amp;lt;vm_id&amp;gt; &amp;lt;disk&amp;gt; &amp;lt;storage_name&amp;gt; --format qcow2 --delete &lt;span class="m">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 移动容器卷到local&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pct move-volume &amp;lt;vm_id&amp;gt; &amp;lt;volume&amp;gt; &amp;lt;storage_name&amp;gt; --delete &lt;span class="m">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 删除local-lvm存储&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">lvremove pve/data
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 空间合并到local&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">lvextend -l +100%FREE -r pve/root
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 在WebUI的“数据中心”-&amp;#34;存储&amp;#34;里，手动移除local-lvm&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="宿主机">宿主机&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 修改主机名&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hostnamectl set-hostname &amp;lt;new_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 编辑/etc/hosts文件&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">nano /etc/hosts
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">127.0.0.1 localhost.localdomain localhost
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">192.168.x.xxx &amp;lt;new_name&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;domain&amp;gt; &amp;lt;new_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 重启 PVE 相关服务&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 更新 SSL 证书&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">systemctl restart pve-cluster &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> pvecm updatecerts --force &lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> systemctl restart pveproxy pvedaemon
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 修改监控数据目录&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">systemctl stop rrdcached
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">mv /var/lib/rrdcached/db/pve2-node/&amp;lt;old_name&amp;gt; /var/lib/rrdcached/db/pve2-node/&amp;lt;new_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">mv /var/lib/rrdcached/db/pve2-storage/&amp;lt;old_name&amp;gt; /var/lib/rrdcached/db/pve2-storage/&amp;lt;new_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">systemctl start rrdcached &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span> systemctl restart pvedaemon pvestatd pveproxy
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 迁移 LXC 配置&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">mv /etc/pve/nodes/&amp;lt;old_name&amp;gt;/lxc/* /etc/pve/nodes/&amp;lt;new_name&amp;gt;/lxc/ 2&amp;gt;/dev/null
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 迁移 QEMU 配置&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">mv /etc/pve/nodes/&amp;lt;old_name&amp;gt;/qemu-server/* /etc/pve/nodes/&amp;lt;new_name&amp;gt;/qemu-server/ 2&amp;gt;/dev/null
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 删除旧节点目录&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">rm -rf /etc/pve/nodes/&amp;lt;old_name&amp;gt;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># 重启&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">reboot
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div></description></item></channel></rss>